  "notes": [
    "GPU figures are total nvidia-smi usage, including the simulator, all four views, actor, classifier, learner and background baseline.",
    "Used plus free does not equal physical total because approximately 444 MiB is driver-reserved.",
    "Actor and learner share one JAX allocator in local mode; their reported memory figures must not be added together.",
    "All tests use actual synchronized MuJoCo camera pixels. Scripted hold demonstrations and a constant-negative classifier exercise compute, not training quality or success accuracy.",
    "The first five runs publish every update for comparison. The final run uses the original publication interval 50.",
    "A graceful stop finishes an in-flight learner update, so final steps can exceed the requested target by one.",
    "Learner update timings are inferred from half-second status sampling after update three and include the configured CTA 2 cycle.",
    "Camera unavailable counts are initial renderer warmup. Frame age and fresh-frame counts are measured from the deployed Lab camera API.",
    "This is a short integrated execution test, not a long-run training or insertion-success benchmark."
  ]
}
